      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5b21785df50cde783626bd94|full_name}: Not a problem at all. I just wanted to explain why I settled on the quick menu to display the nameplate. All the ideas that have been mentioned regarding the nameplates would be great user options to customise how the nameplate works, and it is possible to eventually get them to perform well enough without sacrificing features. A nameplate is one of the the things that can be run solely on the cpu, gpu or even a mix of both to achieve the desired effect and performance.\n\nKeep your ideas flowing and feel free to post a feature request of your own. In fact there is already a feature request similar to your idea regarding the nameplates, so you can go upvote it if you would like. Just search \"nameplate\" in feature requests to see all the features posted. (https://vrchat.canny.io/feature-requests?search=nameplate).",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
